igned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186548201 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3520d323-c6a4-5bce-bac1-1f4c02bd0068" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Equation of a Circle Given the Center and a Point on the Circle"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2b2745c4-1441-5995-aaf6-0adbc665aef0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+\\frac{9}{2})^{2}+(y+\\frac{1}{2})^{2}=\\frac{25}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548213} {:answer/id #uuid "37d4082a-8911-5b7c-b50a-10c433cbf0c1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+\\frac{9}{2})^{2}+(y-\\frac{1}{2})^{2}=\\frac{25}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548215} {:answer/id #uuid "da3ff54f-5a25-50da-b204-8695bcb437f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-\\frac{9}{2})^{2}+(y+\\frac{1}{2})^{2}=\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548257} {:answer/id #uuid "ea42b5fa-8d2f-550e-9160-d2ffdc3c564b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-\\frac{9}{2})^{2}+(y+\\frac{1}{2})^{2}=\\frac{25}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548262} {:answer/id #uuid "ec1aadba-47b2-5657-83f5-47a149777663" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+\\frac{9}{2})^{2}+(y-\\frac{1}{2})^{2}=\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548264}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "37d4082a-8911-5b7c-b50a-10c433cbf0c1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+\\frac{9}{2})^{2}+(y-\\frac{1}{2})^{2}=\\frac{25}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548215} :answer-field/id #uuid "16be170c-c7ff-5a97-93c7-1025786aea44" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548209}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "0d76f3ef-fa61-505b-b0e2-335ce30237ba" :question/problem "![](images/07/0760173ffa9ede7dc926ff42ddc2a2474433408c2320bc6e37f7dc95ffde2dd1.png)\n\nThe circle above is centered at $C(- \\frac{9}{2},\\frac{1}{2})$ and the point $X(-7,3)$ lies on the circumference. Find the equation of the circle." :question/worked-solution "The general equation of a circle with radius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is\n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nThe length of the radius is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CX & =\\sqrt{{(-7-(- \\frac{9}{2}))}^{2}+{(3-\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(- \\frac{5}{2})^{2}+{\\frac{5}{2}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{25}{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, our circle is generated by the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-(- \\frac{9}{2}))^{2}+(y-\\frac{1}{2})^{2} & =(\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2})^{2} \\\\ (x+\\frac{9}{2})^{2}+(y-\\frac{1}{2})^{2} & =\\frac{25}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186548202 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3520d323-c6a4-5bce-bac1-1f4c02bd0068" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Equation of a Circle Given the Center and a Point on the Circle"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29b47133-63e9-5e3f-aa5f-58a0b6d5b596" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+1)^{2}+y^{2}=100" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548212} {:answer/id #uuid "3ec27f71-d7bc-5500-837c-5761a7ac8900" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+1)^{2}+y^{2}=64" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548220} {:answer/id #uuid "5fd614b5-d1e2-5013-98a1-1892641da572" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-1)^{2}+y^{2}=100" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548229} {:answer/id #uuid "af57762a-cff1-5cc5-a0c6-035779936177" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+1)^{2}+y^{2}=10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548250} {:answer/id #uuid "e2c14cd4-0321-5ab6-9b82-e326aa414ef5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+9)^{2}+(y+6)^{2}=100" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548259}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "29b47133-63e