fbcfd2a35e0a952ec4.png)\n\nThe circle above is centered at $C(\\frac{9}{2},\\frac{1}{2})$ and the point $X(9,0)$ lies on the circumference. Find the equation of the circle." :question/worked-solution "The general equation of a circle with radius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is\n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nThe length of the radius is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CX & =\\sqrt{{(9-\\frac{9}{2})}^{2}+{(0-\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{\\frac{9}{2}}^{2}+(- \\frac{1}{2})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{41}{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{82}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, our circle is generated by the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-\\frac{9}{2})^{2}+(y-\\frac{1}{2})^{2} & =(\\frac{\\sqrt{82}}{2})^{2} \\\\ (x-\\frac{9}{2})^{2}+(y-\\frac{1}{2})^{2} & =\\frac{41}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186548221 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3520d323-c6a4-5bce-bac1-1f4c02bd0068" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Equation of a Circle Given the Center and a Point on the Circle"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02f3a371-90b3-5820-b7e7-347e54e54605" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+\\frac{5}{2})^{2}+(y+\\frac{3}{2})^{2}=\\frac{17}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548198} {:answer/id #uuid "4dd54287-8140-5f03-acdf-0a4831cff2e9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-\\frac{5}{2})^{2}+(y-\\frac{3}{2})^{2}=\\frac{17}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548223} {:answer/id #uuid "6d26a780-95be-51f5-a531-636109e92dda" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+\\frac{5}{2})^{2}+(y-\\frac{3}{2})^{2}=\\frac{17}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548232} {:answer/id #uuid "7cfee1a0-b506-54e0-baf6-5d9cb75b24ee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+\\frac{5}{2})^{2}+(y+\\frac{3}{2})^{2}=\\frac{\\sqrt{34}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548237} {:answer/id #uuid "fa872b31-3bf5-50bc-b665-769a