2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-(-3))^{2}+(y-0)^{2} & =(5)^{2} \\\\ (x+3)^{2}+y^{2} & =25\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Equation of a Circle Given the Center and a Point on the Circle"}]}
